---
config:
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: true
    curve: linear
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"
    fontSize: 18px
    primaryTextColor: "#233247"
    lineColor: "#52657a"
    clusterBkg: "#f8fafc"
    clusterBorder: "#94a3b8"
---
flowchart LR
    P[Producer 追加数据] --> Q[Partition 中已有排队数据]
    Q -. 唤醒提示 .-> W[等待 pending-data 通知]
    W -. 通知 .-> D{尝试拉取下一批<br/>有数据？}
    S[扫描已分配 Partition<br/>round-robin] --> D
    D -- 是 --> B[机会式批量消费<br/>最多 BatchSize 条已排队数据]
    B --> S
    D -- 否 --> W
